{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51846","headline":"哭从伯祭酒 · 无名氏","name":"哭从伯祭酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剖符冯翊次，以疾拜司成。\n义重疎皆友，仁深怨不生。\n昔居南比省，长话水云情。\n吟讽资高兴，丝纶发重名。\n经秋漳浦卧，一旦逝川声。\n自古谁回得，重泉独往程。\n明灵辞魏阙，冬日冷秦宫。\n〖1〗孝子号天护，铭旌引柩行。\n门阑容足迹，章句许才清。\n劣薄无因报，恩知岂谓轻？\n扪膺词莫吐，奠酒泪先倾。\n从此阶前石，何人肯念贞？\n（愚鲁献孤石蒙赏孤峭。\n同上三○四《悲悼》）（〖1〗「宫」字不韵，赵遂之校作「庭」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}